    "description" : {
      "en" : "Controlled vocabulary of the five battery categories defined in Article 3(1) of Regulation (EU) 2023/1542: portable (9), LMT (11), SLI (12), industrial (13) and electric vehicle (14). Declared as individuals of the cross-sectoral class dpp:ClassificationCode and attached to a battery through dpp:hasProductGroup; no term is declared in the battery namespace. The category conditions the scope of the battery passport."
    },
